I see exactly why you are getting errors. When doing a big find-and-replace, it is very common for a couple of typos to slip through and break the JSX syntax.
Here are the specific errors causing your code to crash, along with a couple of spots that were missed in the replacement.
### 1. Fix the Syntax Errors (Crashing the App)
**Error 1: Typo in the main wrapper**
At around line 625, the sx prop was accidentally typed as ax.
```javascript
// CHANGE THIS:
<Paper ax ={jpStyles.mainPaper}>

// TO THIS:
<Paper sx={jpStyles.mainPaper}>

```
**Error 2: Extra Bracket on the Delete Button**
At around line 953, there is an extra } at the end of the sx prop, which breaks the React component.
```javascript
// CHANGE THIS:
<IconButton
  onClick={() => handleDeleteRow(row.id)}
  aria-label="delete row"
  sx={jpStyles.deleteIconButton}}
>

// TO THIS (Remove the extra bracket at the end):
<IconButton
  onClick={() => handleDeleteRow(row.id)}
  aria-label="delete row"
  sx={jpStyles.deleteIconButton}
>

```
### 2. Remaining Inline Replacements
There are two small places where inline styles were left behind.
**Missed Spot 1: Individual Remarks Caption**
At around line 944, the caption under the "Remarks" field still has inline styles.
```javascript
// CHANGE THIS:
<Typography variant="caption" sx={{ fontSize: "0.65rem", color: "text.secondary", ml: 1.2, display: "block", textAlign: "left" }}>Allowed 2-30 chars (alphabets, numbers)</Typography>

// TO THIS:
<Typography variant="caption" sx={jpStyles.captionText}>Allowed 2-30 chars (alphabets, numbers)</Typography>

```
**Missed Spot 2: Schedule Screen Buttons**
At the very bottom in Step 3 (around lines 1013 and 1021), the two large buttons still have inline styles. First, ensure you have this line in your JournalPostingStyles.js file:
```javascript
largeBtn: { px: 4, py: 1.5, fontWeight: "bold" },

```
Then, update both buttons:
```javascript
// CHANGE THIS:
<Button variant="outlined" size="large" onClick={handleResetWizard} sx={{ px: 4, py: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
  Execute Immediately
</Button>

// TO THIS:
<Button variant="outlined" size="large" onClick={handleResetWizard} sx={jpStyles.largeBtn}>
  Execute Immediately
</Button>

```
```javascript
// CHANGE THIS:
<Button variant="contained" size="large" startIcon={<ScheduleIcon />} onClick={() => setShowSchedulePicker(true)} sx={{ px: 4, py: 1.5, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
  Schedule Execution
</Button>

// TO THIS:
<Button variant="contained" size="large" startIcon={<ScheduleIcon />} onClick={() => setShowSchedulePicker(true)} sx={jpStyles.largeBtn}>
  Schedule Execution
</Button>

```
Make these changes, save the file, and the compilation errors will disappear.
